SUMMARY:Yi Peng / Loy Krathong\, Chiang Mai
DESCRIPTION:What you build/use: Make (or buy) a banana-leaf krathong and fl
 oat it.\nHow to join: Free on the Ping River\; main city site is Ton Lamya
 i Market public park (moved from Tha Phae Gate)\; sky lanterns only at aut
 horised venues.\nLevel: Build. Experience #10 in experiences_v1.csv.\nNote
 : Official: Chiang Mai Yi Peng 23-25 Nov 2026 (PRD Radio Thailand Chiang M
 ai\, 24 Sep 2026)\; main site Ton Lamyai Market public park\; Grand Kratho
 ng Parade contest on the Tha Phae Gate to City Hall route\; 25 Nov is the 
 usual parade night\, but the official page does not name the day (not conf
 irmed).\nhttps://radiochiangmai.prd.go.th/th/content/category/detail/id/57
 /iid/544713\nMore: https://nomad.curiosta.com/experiences/yi-peng-loy-krat
 hong-chiang-mai/
