 ist). The International Kite Festival 2027 runs 10–14 Jan 2027 at Sabarm
 ati Riverfront\, Ahmedabad (Incredible India\, source: Gujarat Tourism).\n
 https://sromarol.esic.gov.in/attachments/circularfile/Holidays_to_be_obser
 ved_in_Central_Government_Offices_during_the_year_2027_reg_1786507084.pdf\
 nMore: https://nomad.curiosta.com/experiences/uttarayan-ahmedabad/
